"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"iZ7-gwaBWYHiWhez4514jA","review_id":"z0_rpckuZsCCwvSniYA4Sw","date":"2018-06-07T19:20:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9354088306427002,"text_excerpt":"Really diggin' the vendors! So, I've tried the St.Roch Market and Auction House before, but I'd have to say this one is my favorite! I felt that Pythian gives a wide variety of what New Orleans has to offer. There's a parking lot for $8, but if you come after 7pm it's free street parking. (Fave to least) Eat Well Banh Mi - $12 - char siu pork Phoritto - $12 - sliced brisket Stuffed Chicken Wings - $8 - tossed in sweet honey chili sauce I've been eating Eat Well for years at their original canal location. They are seriously my forever top banh mi! The Char Siu Pork is lifeeeee - loaded with meat, pickled carrots, jalapenos and fresh cilantro! I promise you, you won't be disappointed! The p..."},{"business_id":"iZ7-gwaBWYHiWhez4514jA","review_id":"r-GJj0uCgmwxldrAS14imA","date":"2019-08-30T16:10:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9344857931137085,"text_excerpt":"I feel like more of a \"superfan\" when it comes to The Pythian. I love the food and I enjoy the drinks even more. Plus, I go there...A LOT. This is the perfect food hall for an escape from your #SadOfficeSalad, a coffee break pick-me-up during the workday and especially a chill happy hour after you're done being an adult for the day. BOOO! I love that you can purchase food from different spots and take a seat at the bar if you so wish and order a drink. The possibilities are endless. It's a happy hour dream come true. Anyways! Here are a few of my favorites inside: La Cocinita has some of the best Latin American food! Their daily specials are always sure to satisfy. Ground beef and tostone..."},{"business_id":"iZ7-gwaBWYHiWhez4514jA","review_id":"XttMYCbbmffMudbEehBDoA","date":"2018-11-19T19:50:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9340599775314331,"text_excerpt":"I had been dying to try Pythian Market for months and was so excited to finally check it out before a saints game. Food halls/courts are popping up a lot these days and so far this has been my favorite experience. The decor inside feels warm, inviting and laid back. Also the signs and murals inside were done by a local nola woman owned business which makes me happy always. Even though it was Saints Sunday and very busy inside it was very well organized so we didn't have to wait long for drinks or food. As there were only 2 of us we couldn't really eat family style which I imagine is the best thing to do here with a group of friends. The pizza from Meribo was some of the best flavor bites ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iZ7-gwaBWYHiWhez4514jA","photo_id":"ZhcPVqm1gBNHpssHw91Z7g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ZhcPVqm1gBNHpssHw91Z7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8761764168739319},{"business_id":"iZ7-gwaBWYHiWhez4514jA","photo_id":"9QhbJZvuUgwN1VHkejVofg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/9QhbJZvuUgwN1VHke